      "title": "Ideahazard one of the OGs: What is SPX6900 ? A legitimate protest against the institution of finance",
      "description": "Taken from 'flip the stock market' Podcast: Occupy Wall Street had a message and no way to fund itself. Ideahazard explains the part everyone outside the community misses about SPX6900 being a token on Ethereum: the protest and the fundraising mechanism are the same object, and every buy is a flow pulled out of Vanguard and State Street into something the community owns. Subscribe for more on SPX6900 and flipping the stock market. Follow FTSM on all socials: https://linktr.ee/flipstockmarket Co-hosts: Cow — https://x.com/realcryptocow Matt Beck — https://x.com/Matthew_C_Beck Mang — https://x.com/cryptic_mang Tanz — https://x.com/ghostoftanzcho Guests: Ideahazard — https://x.com/1d34h4z4rd Ba",
